<speak>I remember a list down one side and a page of messages in the middle. I thought the attachment would be in the message area because I'd seen a notification there. Then I clicked back and landed at the overview, so I started again. I wasn't sure whether I should be looking in correspondence or documents. It may just have been me using the smaller screen. On the phone, some headings looked similar once I scrolled, and I lost track of which section I was actually in.</speak>